<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, mostly in
		pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boastful promises, boasts,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦ τοι ἀπειλαὶ ἃς . . ὑπίσχεο
					οἰνοποτάζων;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι τῶν ἀπειλῶν γενναῖος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					59.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				704.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> commonly in
			pl., <i>threats,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦ τοι ἀπειλαὶ οἴχονται τὰς Τρωσὶν
					ἀπείλεον υἷες Ἀχαιῶν;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.219
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ . . λήθετ᾽ ἀπειλάων τὰς
					ἀντιθέῳ Ὀδυσῆι πρῶτον ἐπηπείλησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύνειν ἀπειλαῖς καὶ πληγαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					325d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				175
			</span></i> (lyr.): in sg., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				753
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλῆς ἕνεκα τοῖς ἐν τῷ Ταρτάρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					94b33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of threatening
			conditions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πνιγμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.60
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐν ἀπειλῇ
			ἀποστήματα</span> Heras ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.815
			</span></i>; of storms, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.21.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
